1. To create vendor-source tarballs
bash make_vendor

2. To build
sudo bash slacker-vendor.SlackBuild

NOTES:
      To verify crates with appstream you need ON for net.
      If auditable used on cargo build then you run audit binaries (if you have installed audit) like this:
       cargo audit bin /tmp/package-slacker/usr/bin/slacker
       cargo audit bin /tmp/package-slacker/usr/bin/slacker-gui
